# 统一行尾为 LF，避免 Windows 上 clone 后出现满屏 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告，
# 也避免同一文件在不同机器上产生无意义的整文件 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源不做行尾转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF（.bat/.cmd/.ps1 对行尾敏感）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 让 git 在 diff 时把锁文件当二进制，避免巨大的无意义 diff
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated=true
